──────────────────────────────────────────
LangGraph agent that polls for Motor claims in 'Claim Intake Validation'
status and runs the intake validation checks (policy, FNOL completeness,
fraud screening) — replicating the Replit app's logic in Python/LangGraph.

On pass  → claim advanced to 'Triage Pending' (MotorTriageAgent picks it up)
